# Then regrade becomes the speed multiplier

Once **one** Letta run succeeds:

```text
R001
```

stop rerunning it while debugging assessors.

Run:

```text
R001
  ↓
Assessor v0
  ↓
Assessor v1
  ↓
Assessor v2
  ↓
Assessor v3
```

This is where we eliminate most of the expensive/slow agent iterations.

Only rerun Letta when the independent variable is:

```text
worker
memory
skill
process
model
```

Not when you're changing:

```text
evaluator
Hydra projection
UI
statistics
receipt format
World metadata
```

